# horizon - rolling 16th bass under a sustained major stab
bpm 138
swing 0
humanize kick 0
humanize hat 0
humanize oh 0
humanize clap 0
humanize snare 0
humanize perc 0
humanize bass 0
humanize stab 0
kick x...x...x...x...
hat xx.xxx.xxx.xxx.x
filter hat hp 8000
bass f1 e1! f1 g1 . a1! b1~ g1~ a1! a0 a1! a1 . f1 f2 e2
filter bass lp 1200 res 0.3
sidechain bass 0.4
stab a1 . . . . . . . g1! e1 f1 . d1 . . e1
filter stab lp 3000 res 0.2
sidechain stab 0.3
